1
00:00:00,638 --> 00:00:04,078
(Bernadette:)You just heard me
throwing up.

2
00:00:04,075 --> 00:00:07,405
(Howard:)You bet I did.

3
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:16,050
(Bernadette:)You're so weird.

4
00:00:16,053 --> 00:00:18,083
(Howard:)You know what's weird?

5
00:00:22,393 --> 00:00:24,893
(Howard:)How turned on
you are right now.

6
00:00:27,698 --> 00:00:29,428
(Sheldon:)You know, people are quick
to accuse me

7
00:00:29,433 --> 00:00:30,833
(Sheldon:)of being difficult
to live with,

8
00:00:30,835 --> 00:00:33,535
(Sheldon:)but the truth is,
Amy is just as challenging.

9
00:00:33,537 --> 00:00:35,937
(Sheldon:)Just as challenging.

10
00:00:35,940 --> 00:00:37,110
(Sheldon:)Yes.

11
00:00:37,108 --> 00:00:39,908
(Penny:)As you.

12
00:00:39,910 --> 00:00:41,280
(Sheldon:)Yes.

13
00:00:41,278 --> 00:00:44,078
(Penny:)Just as challenging as you.

14
00:00:46,183 --> 00:00:47,453
(Sheldon:)When we're sleeping,

15
00:00:47,451 --> 00:00:48,881
(Sheldon:)she breathes on me.

16
00:00:48,886 --> 00:00:51,216
(Sheldon:)One night, it got so bad
I almost grabbed Toto

17
00:00:51,222 --> 00:00:53,652
and headed for the storm cellar.

18
00:00:53,658 --> 00:00:55,658
(Penny:)Leonard breathes on me, too.

19
00:00:55,660 --> 00:00:57,230
(Penny:)It's not a big deal.

